cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: Pre-flight odontogenic-risk decision model
abstract: >-
  Decision-analytic Monte Carlo model comparing four pre-flight dental policies
  for missions without evacuation, from retention to full clearance. Locates the
  isolation threshold at which the harm-minimising policy shifts, and reports a
  structural sensitivity analysis over the assumptions that drive the decision.
type: software
version: 1.0.5
